    "name": "Solitary Ash",
    "steam_appid": 2819430,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819430/extras/b82fb72d9db502f4d2a0fce121015f5e.webp?t=1742564137\" width=616 height=63 /></span><br><strong>Solitary Ash</strong> is a hybrid narrative adventure game set in a post-apocalyptic Europe following a catastrophic event, focusing on moral choices and exploration.<br><br>A man with amnesia wakes up in an underground prison and sets out on a journey of self-discovery through a freezing and deserted Europe to find his family and get revenge on his captors. Along the way, he helps the remaining human communities and makes moral choices that shape his journey. This is an immersive cinematic experience with stylized graphics, a minimalistic score, and a quest to spark hope in a lonely traveler.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819430/extras/a4604a45bc0dc4394767b19674178346.webp?t=1742564137\" width=616 height=63 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819430/extras/c3c2d442eb4e3d5add1badcae2c22071.webp?t=1742564137\" width=616 height=34 /></span><br><br>Journey across the <strong>Ash</strong>, the desolate floor of a vanished Danube river, as you recover your lost memories. Traverse the abandoned world, forging connections with isolated tribes, and explore the last <strong>underground Shelter citadels</strong>. Gather old <i>tape recordings</i> and messages from an old <i>walkie-talkie</i>, and seek out ancient monuments and artifacts hidden in desolation.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819430/extras/dc2bebc345f87cbd6a22eb47f94ef4d8.poster.avif?t=1742564137\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819430/extras/dc2bebc345f87cbd6a22eb47f94ef4d8.webm?t=1742564137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819430/extras/dc2bebc345f87cbd6a22eb47f94ef4d8.mp4?t=1742564137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819430/extras/6dc414fd0441550465470f920f9b915c.webp?t=1742564137\" width=616 height=34 /></span><br><br>As you wander the <strong>Ash</strong>, you shall face the tyranny of feudal <strong>Guilds</strong> who exploit the remnants of humankind and you will defy a zealous cult that sacrifices its followers to the ruthless <strong>Sun God</strong>. Navigate the desperate conflict over dwindling water, and uncover a narrative that branches with every moral choice you make.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819430/extras/1a0a930fb4c5ffe55aa58fc134b3c86f.poster.avif?t=1742564137\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819430/extras/1a0a930fb4c5ffe55aa58fc134b3c86f.webm?t=1742564137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819430/extras/1a0a930fb4c5ffe55aa58fc134b3c86f.mp4?t=1742564137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819430/extras/b56feccbf3da95de459c8daa56105583.webp?t=1742564137\" width=616 height=34 /></span><br><br>Search the barren <strong>Ash</strong> for lost fragments from the old world and <i>craft</i> or <i>repair</i> what you find. Ration your water and supplies, <i>barter</i> for ancient artifacts, and <strong>interact</strong> with characters both strange and unforgettable.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819430/extras/05ea715e89a37be5c5a2510c7db307a2.poster.avif?t=1742564137\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819430/extras/05ea715e89a37be5c5a2510c7db307a2.webm?t=1742564137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819430/extras/05ea715e89a37be5c5a2510c7db307a2.mp4?t=1742564137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819430/extras/b82fb72d9db502f4d2a0fce121015f5e.webp?t=1742564137\" width=616 height=63 /></span><br><strong>Solitary Ash</strong> is a hybrid narrative adventure game set in a post-apocalyptic Europe following a catastrophic event, focusing on moral choices and exploration.<br><br>A man with amnesia wakes up in an underground prison and sets out on a journey of self-discovery through a freezing and deserted Europe to find his family and get revenge on his captors. Along the way, he helps the remaining human communities and makes moral choices that shape his journey. This is an immersive cinematic experience with stylized graphics, a minimalistic score, and a quest to spark hope in a lonely traveler.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819430/extras/a4604a45bc0dc4394767b19674178346.webp?t=1742564137\" width=616 height=63 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819430/extras/c3c2d442eb4e3d5add1badcae2c22071.webp?t=1742564137\" width=616 height=34 /></span><br><br>Journey across the <strong>Ash</strong>, the desolate floor of a vanished Danube river, as you recover your lost memories. Traverse the abandoned world, forging connections with isolated tribes, and explore the last <strong>underground Shelter citadels</strong>. Gather old <i>tape recordings</i> and messages from an old <i>walkie-talkie</i>, and seek out ancient monuments and artifacts hidden in desolation.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819430/extras/dc2bebc345f87cbd6a22eb47f94ef4d8.poster.avif?t=1742564137\" width=616 height=346 ><source sr