nt artifacts, and <strong>interact</strong> with characters both strange and unforgettable.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819430/extras/05ea715e89a37be5c5a2510c7db307a2.poster.avif?t=1742564137\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819430/extras/05ea715e89a37be5c5a2510c7db307a2.webm?t=1742564137\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2819430/extras/05ea715e89a37be5c5a2510c7db307a2.mp4?t=1742564137\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
